  "variant_convention": "A template may ask for a case or mood variant of a slot with the suffix form slot|variant. The generator looks for a flat key '<lang>_<variant>' first (for example it_sub) and then for a 'variant' object keyed by language (for example acc -> de). If the variant is missing the default surface form is used.",
